          <a href="#top-picks" class="text-sm text-gray-600 hover:text-[#1E90FF] no-underline py-1 font-medium">3. Our 7 Top Picks Reviewed</a>
          <a href="#how-to-apply" class="text-sm text-gray-600 hover:text-[#1E90FF] no-underline py-1 font-medium">4. How to Apply It Properly</a>
          <a href="#when-paint-is-wrong" class="text-sm text-gray-600 hover:text-[#1E90FF] no-underline py-1 font-medium">5. When Paint Is the Wrong Answer</a>
          <a href="#cost" class="text-sm text-gray-600 hover:text-[#1E90FF] no-underline py-1 font-medium">6. What the Job Actually Costs</a>
          <a href="#common-mistakes" class="text-sm text-gray-600 hover:text-[#1E90FF] no-underline py-1 font-medium">7. Common Mistakes</a>
          <a href="#faq" class="text-sm text-gray-600 hover:text-[#1E90FF] no-underline py-1 font-medium">8. FAQ</a>
        </nav>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Content -->
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 pb-16 lg:pb-24">
